{title: 525 - Hiding in Thee}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #525 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 525}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Gm]O safe [Fm/C]to [Eb/Bb]the Rock [Fm/Ab]that [Cm/G]is [F7]higher [Ab]than [Bb7/Ab]I,
[Cm/G]My [Eb]soul in [Ab]its [Gm]conflicts [Eb/Bb]and [Bb]sorrows [F]would [Bb/F]fly;
[Bb7/Ab]Sosinful, [Eb/Bb]so [Fm/Ab]weary, [Bb/F]Thine, [Ab]Thine, [Bb7/Ab]would [Cm/G]I [Ab/Eb]be;
[Ab]Thou blest [Gm]“Rock [Eb]of Ages,” I’m [Bb7/Ab]hiding [Bb]inThee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Bb]Hiding [Bb7]in [Eb/Bb]Thee, hiding [Bb7/F]in [Gm]Thee,
[Bb]Thou [Eb/Bb]blest [Bb]"Rock of [Eb]Ages,"
[Eb/G]I'm hiding [Bb7/Ab]in [Eb]Thee.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Gm]In the [Fm/C]calm [Eb/Bb]of the [Fm/Ab]noontide, [F7]in [Bb/F]sorrow's [Bb7/Ab]lone [Cm/G]hour,
[Cm/G]In times [Eb/Bb]when [Ab]temptation [Gm/Bb]casts [Eb/Bb]over [Bb]me [Eb/Bb]its [F]power;
[Bb7/Ab]In [Gm]the [Fm/C]tempests of [Cm/G]life, [F7]on [Bb/F]its [Bb7/Ab]wide, [Cm/G]heaving [Ab/Eb]sea,
[Ab]Thou blest [Gm]"Rock [Eb]of Ages," I'm [Bb7/Ab]hiding [Bb]in Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Gm]How oft [Fm/C]in [Eb/Bb]the conflict, [Cm/G]when [F7]pressed [Bb/F]by [Ab]the [Bb7/Ab]foe,
[Cm/G]I have [Eb]fled to [Ab]my [Gm]refuge [Eb/Bb]and [Bb]breathed [Eb/Bb]out [F]my [Bb/F]woe;
[Bb7/Ab]How [Gm]often, [Eb/Bb]when [Cm/G]trials [F7]like [Ab]sea [Bb7/Ab]billows [Ab/Eb]roll,
[Ab]Have I [Gm]hidden [Eb/G]in Thee, O Thou [Bb7/Ab]Rock [Cm/G]of [Bb]my soul.
{end_of_verse}
